# ── DSH plugin workspace ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal agent-team working notes (research, contracts, verification reports,
# local dev harnesses). They contain machine-specific paths and live test data,
# so they stay local; shipped plugin sources live under plugins/.
.team/

# ── Secrets: never commit credentials, keys, or environment files ────────────
# DSH credential stores and commonly copied secret files.
.credentials.yaml
**/.credentials.yaml
.dsh/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
.ssh/
.npmrc

# ── Node / package manager ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.tsbuildinfo
.cache/
.turbo/
*.tgz
# Lockfiles are intentionally NOT ignored: once a plugin introduces build or
# dev dependencies, its pnpm-lock.yaml must be committed for reproducibility.

# ── Logs / temp / runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.local
*.tmp
.tmp/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
__MACOSX/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
